<section class="principles section container" aria-labelledby="principles-heading"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / STAY IN THE LOOP</p><h2 id="principles-heading">AI helps you explore.<br> You make the call.</h2></div><p>Good analysis depends on more than a convincing chart. Datly makes the intermediate work available for you to examine.</p></div><div class="principle-grid">
<article><span class="mini-label">TRACE THE QUESTION</span><h3>Keep your train<br> of thought.</h3><p>Data threads organise questions, transformations, derived tables, and charts. Follow an investigation as it develops.</p><a class="text-link" href="#product" data-select-feature="threads">Explore data threads <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
<article><span class="mini-label">REFINE THE VIEW</span><h3>A chart you can<br> work with.</h3><p>Use visual encoding controls for axes, colour, and other chart properties. Adjust the view as your question becomes more precise.</p><a class="text-link" href="#product" data-select-feature="explore">Explore the canvas <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
<article><span class="mini-label">EXPLAIN THE FINDING</span><h3>More than<br> a screenshot.</h3><p>Combine written context with chart images in an editable report. Save an image or use your browser’s print flow for PDF.</p><a class="text-link" href="#product" data-select-feature="reports">Explore reports <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
</div></section>
